'Updated Progr. for Eppley 8-48 Change-out.
'Updated for 8-48 Multiplier, new Multiplier 8.62
'Previous Multiplier 10.82
'
'
'Date: 26 May 2022, Program Update
'Updated AirTemp Sensor Models form 060A2 to 061 and had to adjust 
'multiplier & offsett along with 'scaling resistor callout.
'
'
'Date:  17 March, 2021; Program Update
'Program New Version: TA49_V7.CR3
'Changed-Out Eppley Sensor SN-16819 with SN-29209.
'SN-16819 multiplier was 11.10; SN-29209 multiplier is 10.82.
'
'
'
' Date:  July 7, 2020
' New Program:  TA49_V6-2.CR3
' Replaced Eppley 8-48 Sensor, updated constant/multiplier to 11.10.
' Changed-Out Datalogger for periodic calibration.
' Previous 8-48 constant/multiplier was 9.73.
' Old Program:  TA49_V6-1.CR3
'
'
'
'Date: Jan 26, 2018
' New Program: TA49_V5.CR3
' Old Program: TA49_V4.CR3
'
'
'
'Updated to TA49_V6-1.CRS on 01152020 for Sensor Change-Out.
' Version TA49_V6-1.CR3 GTStanton updated Eppley Sensor Constant from 
'9.27 to 9.73 for the newly installed sensor on 01152020 @ 1012hrs MST.
'
'
'=====================================================================
'Version:5   26 January 2018 Jason Ritter (JCR), Campbell Scientific
'Updated program to version 6, adding the following Public variables
'PrecipToday - Precipitation since midnight, updated every 15 minutes
'MaxGustToday - Maximum wind gust since midnight (speed at level 1 only), updated every 15 minutes
'WindChill_C - Wind chill at level 1 only, deg C, updated every 15 minutes, calculated with:
'              WindChill = 35.74 + (0.6215*temp0) - (35.75*speed1^0.16) + (0.4275*temp0*speed1^0.16)
'              with speed1 in mph and temp0 in deg F
'              Then WindChill_C = (WindChill -32)/1.8
'SigmaPhi &
'SigmaTheta-stability at level 1 only, nighttime shortwave down measurement <6 W/m2
'
'=====================================================================
'
'
'
'Updted Program to TA49_V4.CRS on 02062017 by GTStanton
'Reversed BRHalf Measurements to True and added settling time
'from 0 to 20000uSeconds.  Note test changes of BRHalf to False Excitation
' did NOT make a difference int he L1 & L2 Air Temp Measurement issues.
'
'
'Test Program Update to TA49_V3_1.CR2 on 12012016. By GTStanton
'Changed BRHalf Air Temp Measurements to False from True to see if change effects
'the L1 Air Temp measurement intermittency to jump high.
'
'Updated to V3 on11092016 by GTStanton
'Changed-Out Eppley Sensor, old Multiplier: 12.06
'New Eppley Sensor Multiplier:  9.27
'
'
'Date: July 30, 2014'
' New Program: TA49_V1.CR3
' Old Program: TA6_Combined-SCW.CR3
' Comments:
' Updates created on 08-17-2015 noted below.
' Updated PSP Sensor Multiplier to current value 12.06 from 10.78, on 08172015.
'Correct Solar Sensor Conversion Multiplier to 1E6 from 1E5.
' Updated Cosine Effect into conversion multipler for Vertical Wind Speed to 0.0225.
'
'
